31236::$$$message_0235_0000_0000$$$::Nothing out of the ordinary here.[lr]::
31237::$$$message_0235_0000_0001$$$::There's zero foot traffic, and I can hear the bustle of family life coming from inside the houses.[lr]::
31238::$$$message_0235_0000_0002$$$::The town is the picture of peace, and this moonlit night is the perfect time for an evening stroll.::
31239::$$$message_0235_0001_0000$$$::"Nothing out of the ordinary. Guess I'll move on."[lr]::
31240::$$$message_0235_0001_0001$$$::I leave the Japanese-style neighborhoods behind.[lr]::
31241::$$$message_0235_0001_0002$$$::Once I do, I spot a few pedestrians in the corner of my eye.[lr]::
31242::$$$message_0235_0001_0003$$$::The brief sight leaves a faint impression in my memory, as thin as origami paper.::

